    "name": "PlaxionMediator.Sample.WebApi",
    "description": "CRUD sample built with PlaxionMediator.AspNetCore + PlaxionMediator.MinimalApis (Phase B/D). Exercises MapPlaxionMediatorPost/Get/Put/Patch/Delete, ProblemDetails exception-handling middleware, global ValidationBehavior, CachingBehavior, RetryBehavior, CircuitBreakerBehavior (v0.4.x), and TransactionBehavior + EF Core orders demo (v0.8.0). Pipeline order: Validation → Caching → CircuitBreaker → Retry → Transaction → Handler.\n\nRun the sample first:\n`dotnet run --project samples/PlaxionMediator.Sample.WebApi`\n\nDefault URL: http://localhost:5000",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
